  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Peel and slice the kiwifruit into 1-inch pieces.",
    "In a bowl, mix together the feta cheese, tagine spice blend, sugar, and lemon juice.",
    "Add the kiwifruit pieces to the bowl and toss to coat with the spice mixture.",
    "Transfer the kiwifruit mixture to a 9x13 inch baking dish.",
    "Drizzle with water and sprinkle with honey.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes or until the kiwifruit is tender.",
    "Top with chopped pistachios and serve warm."
